# head/adult/marks_freckles: freckles: a scatter over the nose and the cheeks in skin step 1 (STYLE_P2 4)
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Inside A3's fixed face rows, so they fit every head type. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role marks freckles
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 1
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -5 -11
|.r..r.
|r....r

view D key rest when woman replace
|.r..r.
|r.....

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -9 -11
|r.r
|.r.

view L key rest origin -4 -11
|r.r
|.r.
